# Patches the contiguity guard would otherwise flag, which we have looked at and
# decided against. One regex per line, same matching rules as ogc.select.
#
# This file exists so that "we reviewed it and said no" is distinguishable from
# "nobody has looked at it yet". The guard fails on the latter, not the former.
#
# Empty at v7.2.1-ogc3: nothing sits inside the selected numeric span that we
# do not take.
